SERVER CORE (Lightweight Baseline)       DESKTOP EXPERIENCE (Full Management)
+----------------------------------+     +----------------------------------+
|           Command Line           |     |        Server Manager / GUI      |
|         PowerShell / CMD         |     |        Desktop Environment       |
+----------------------------------+     +----------------------------------+
|          Core System Services    |     |       Core System Services       |
+----------------------------------+     +----------------------------------+
|          Windows Kernel          |     |          Windows Kernel          |
+----------------------------------+     +----------------------------------+
 * Footprint: ~1.5 GB RAM                * Footprint: ~2.5+ GB RAM
