## 🚨 Common Pitfalls & Troubleshooting

* Error: Windows cannot find the Microsoft Software License Terms.
  * Cause: VMware Easy Install or VirtualBox unattended setup conflicts with answer files, or insufficient assigned RAM.
  * Fix: Remove virtual floppy drives (autoinst.flp), disable unattended installation options, and assign at least 2048 MB RAM.

* Error: Accidental Black Screen on Server Core / Explorer Crash.
  * Cause: Command prompt or shell window was closed manually.
  * Fix: Press Ctrl + Shift + Esc -> Click File -> Run new task -> Type cmd.exe or powershell.exe.

* Error: Unable to connect via Remote Desktop (RDP).
  * Cause: Host firewall blocking TCP Port 3389 or network profile set to Public.
  * Fix: Enable the Remote Desktop firewall group or change the network location profile to Private.

